{"id":118098747383977,"name":"[BIG UPDATE] Mancing Indo","desc":"🌊 Welcome to Mancing Indo! 🌊\n\nExperience the ultimate fishing adventure inspired by the marine life of Indonesia! 🇮🇩 Cast your line to catch local fish, sail traditional boats, and explore beautiful islands.\n\n🌴 EXPLORE: Sail to Boomerang Island, Thousand Islands, Crab King Island & Bagang Luar! \n🐟 CATCH: Reel in 40+ realistic fish, from Kakap Merah to Marlin Hitam & Tuna Gigi Anjing! \n⛵ SAIL: Drive authentic Indonesian fishing boats. \n\n[🎣 How To Fish: Classic] \n• Equip rod and click/hold to cast.\n• Wait for a bite & watch the bobber.\n• Click and hold to reel in your catch!\n• PC: Hold the 'E' key to reel in\n• Sell fish to upgrade gear & buy boats.\n\n[🏆 How To Fish: Galatama] \n• Equip Galatama rod and wait for a strike.\n• Mobile/Console: Rotate the reel clockwise to pull.\n• PC: Hold the 'E' key to reel in!\n• ⚠️ TENSION: When the fish struggles, STOP reeling immediately or it will escape! Wait for the fish to calm down, then continue to reel.\n\n⭐ Like, Favorite & join Nusantara Bloxy Studio! ","path":"/game/118098747383977-mancing-indo","slug":"118098747383977-mancing-indo","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1f7896474341d0467cb5ef8bee2728e24bcb455977407e4dd60c40f30357d02f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-614fefbcbcaf6c7424a4de2013494359/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3,"visitor":499478,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-09T10:11:53.723Z","creator":{"name":"Nusantara Bloxy Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"BIG-UPDATE-Mancing-Indo-Best-Script-195390","_id":"69d77b69c5616c48d50b0ebe","title":"Best Script","game":{"_id":"69d77a746e5b3699840dc37e","gameId":118098747383977,"name":"[BIG UPDATE] Mancing Indo","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},